x":0},"rules":"Income-eligible owners and renters of 1-4 family homes. Low income: free upgrades up to $12,000 upstate or $14,000 downstate. Moderate income: 50% of cost up to $6,000 upstate or $7,000 downstate. Federal Home Energy Rebate money is delivered through EmPower+.","status":"active","verified_on":"2026-09-26","source_url":"https://www.nyserda.ny.gov/All-Programs/EmPower-New-York-Program"}],"notes":["Clean Heat incentives are capped at 70% of project cost (85% in a disadvantaged community).","New York has no general solar rebate for market-rate homes, and the federal solar credit ended for 2026 installs.","Amounts are for a single-family home. Apartments get about half. Your contractor confirms your tier."],"closed":[{"name":"Federal 25C / 25D tax credits","status":"closed","source_url":"https://www.irs.gov/credits-deductions/energy-efficient-home-improvement-credit"}],"income_source":null,"verified_on":"2026-09-26"}